    "machine_end_gcode": "; --- 1. Safe Retract ---\nM83 ; Relative extrusion\nG1 E-3 F300 ; Retract to relieve pressure in the Orbiter\n\n; --- 2. Turn off Heaters and Fans ---\nM104 S0 ; Turn off extruder\nM140 S0 ; Turn off bed\nM107 ; Turn off part cooling fan\n\n; --- 3. Move Nozzle Away ---\nG91 ; Relative positioning\nG1 Z5 F3000 ; Lift Z up by 5mm to clear the print\nG90 ; Absolute positioning\n\n; --- 4. Present the Print ---\nG1 X340 Y340 F6000 ; Move toolhead to the back corner (Adjust if needed for Lynx 350)\n\n; --- 5. Final Cleanup ---\nBED_MESH_CLEAR\nM84 X Y E ; Disable steppers\nM117 Print Complete",
