    "machine_start_gcode": "; --- 1. Initial Setup ---\nSET_GCODE_OFFSET Z=0 \nG90 ; Absolute positioning\nM83 ; Extruder relative mode\n\n; --- 2. Pre-heat nozzle (softens plastic) and Heat Bed Fully ---\nM104 S150 \nM117 Heating Bed...\nM190 S[bed_temperature_initial_layer_single]\n\n; --- 3. True Home (Done hot for Cartographer accuracy) ---\nM117 Homing Axes...\nG28\n\n; --- 4. Tram the Bed (Using Z_TILT for your 3-motor setup) ---\nM117 Adjusting Z-Tilt...\nZ_TILT_ADJUST\n\n; --- 5. Re-home Z (Crucial: The gantry moved during tramming) ---\nG28 Z\n\n; --- 6. Bed Mesh Calibration (The fast Cartographer sweep) ---\nM117 Scanning Bed...\nBED_MESH_CALIBRATE ADAPTIVE=1 \n\nSKEW_PROFILE LOAD=lynx_350\n\n; --- 7. Move to the new purge start position (X10 Y10) ---\nG1 X10 Y10 Z5 F6000\n\n; --- 8. Final Extruder Heat (With +/- 5 degree buffer) ---\nM117 Heating Extruder...\nSET_HEATER_TEMPERATURE HEATER=extruder TARGET=[nozzle_temperature_initial_layer]\nTEMPERATURE_WAIT SENSOR=extruder MINIMUM={nozzle_temperature_initial_layer[0] - 5} MAXIMUM={nozzle_temperature_initial_layer[0] + 5}\n\nM117 Heat Soaking (60s)...\nG4 P60000 ; Dwell for 60 seconds\n\n; --- 9. Purge Line ---\nM117 Purging...\nG1 Z0.23 F240      ; Drop down to first layer height\nG92 E0             ; Reset extruder distance\nG1 X120 E15 F1500  ; Draw the first line from X10 out to X110\nG1 Y10.4 F5000     ; Move slightly over to Y10.4\nG1 X10 E15 F1200   ; Draw the second line back to X10\nG92 E0             ; Reset extruder again\nG1 Z2.0 F3000      ; Lift nozzle to clear the purge puddle\n\n; --- 10. Ready to Print ---\nM117 Printing!",
